<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Monday that Huntingdon International, Payless Cashways, American Eagle Group and Buenos Aires Embotelladora SA were unavailable for trading.</p>
<p>National Semiconductor, Airborne Freight, Discount Auto Parts, Harte-Hanks Communications, Amcast Industrial, Pacific Greystone, Storage Technology Corp were unavailable for news.</p>
</text>
